  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida support to the Intensive District Approach to Education for All (IDEAL) project under the umbrella of the Primary Education  Development Programme I from 2000-2004 with Govt. Sida support in 13 out of 36 districts ( others UNICEF). Assessment,appraisal, funding proposal of IDEAL carried out. Sida decision GD 16/95. The project is to provide quality primary education based on local planning.</narrative>
